#: templates/contact/contact.html:5 templates/contact/success.html:5
msgid "Contact"
msgstr "Contact"

#: templates/contact/contact.html:14 templates/contact/success.html:10
msgid "Contacto"
msgstr "Contact"

#: templates/contact/contact.html:15 templates/contact/success.html:11
msgid "Asesoría - Desarrollo - Servicios"
msgstr "Consulting - Development - Services"

#: templates/contact/contact.html:25
msgid "Formulario de contacto"
msgstr "Contact form"

#: templates/contact/contact.html:58
msgid "He leído y acepto la"
msgstr "I have read and accept the "

#: templates/contact/contact.html:60 templates/contact/contact.html:136
msgid "Política de privacidad"
msgstr "Privacy Policy"

#: templates/contact/contact.html:69
msgid ""
"Consiento el uso de mis datos personales para recibir publicidad de su "
"entidad."
msgstr ""
"I consent to the use of my personal data to receive advertising from your "
"entity."

#: templates/contact/contact.html:91
msgid "Enviar mensaje"
msgstr "Send message"

#: templates/contact/contact.html:107
msgid "Información sobre la protección de datos"
msgstr "<strong>Basic information on data protection</strong>"

#: templates/contact/contact.html:112
msgid "Responsable del tratamiento"
msgstr "Data Controller"

#: templates/contact/contact.html:115
msgid "Dirección del responsable"
msgstr "Data Controller Address"

#: templates/contact/contact.html:118
msgid "Finalidad"
msgstr "Purpose"

#: templates/contact/contact.html:119
msgid ""
"Sus datos serán usados para poder atender sus solicitudes y prestarle "
"nuestros servicios."
msgstr ""
"Your data will be used to respond to your requests and provide our services."

#: templates/contact/contact.html:122
msgid "Información de interés"
msgstr "Information of interest"

#: templates/contact/contact.html:123
msgid ""
"Únicamente le enviaremos comunicaciones de su interés con su autorización "
"previa."
msgstr "We will only process your data with your prior consent."

#: templates/contact/contact.html:125
msgid "Legitimación"
msgstr "Legitimation"

#: templates/contact/contact.html:126
msgid "Únicamente trataremos sus datos con su consentimiento previo."
msgstr "We will only process your data with your prior consent."

#: templates/contact/contact.html:128
msgid "Destinatarios"
msgstr "Recipients"

#: templates/contact/contact.html:129
msgid ""
"Solo el personal autorizado tendrá conocimiento de los datos proporcionados."
msgstr "Only authorized personnel will have access to the data provided."

#: templates/contact/contact.html:131
msgid "Derechos"
msgstr "Rights"

#: templates/contact/contact.html:132
msgid ""
"Tiene derecho a saber qué información tenemos sobre usted, corregirla y "
"eliminarla."
msgstr ""
"You have the right to know what information we hold about you, to correct "
"it, and to delete it."

#: templates/contact/contact.html:134
msgid "Información adicional"
msgstr "<strong>Additional Information</strong><br />"

#: templates/contact/contact.html:135
msgid "Más información en"
msgstr "More information at"

#: templates/contact/success.html:23
msgid "Formulario de Contacto"
msgstr "Contact Form"

#: templates/contact/success.html:26
msgid "Gracias por su mensaje"
msgstr "Thank you for your message"

#: templates/contact/success.html:27
msgid "En breve nos pondremos en contacto con Usted."
msgstr "We will contact you shortly."

#: templates/contact/success.html:38
msgid "<strong>Información básica sobre la protección de datos</strong>"
msgstr "<strong>Basic information on data protection</strong>"

#: templates/contact/success.html:39
msgid "<strong>Responsable del tratamiento</strong><br />Joaquín Denis Tremols"
msgstr "<strong>Data Controller</strong><br />Joaquín Denis Tremols"

#: templates/contact/success.html:40
msgid ""
"<strong>Dirección del responsable</strong><br />Calle 25 de Abril 10, piso "
"4, puerta 8, CP 46900, Torrent (Valencia/València)"
msgstr ""
"<strong>Controller's Address</strong><br />Calle 25 de Abril 10, floor 4, "
"door 8, CP 46900, Torrent (Valencia/València)"

#: templates/contact/success.html:41
msgid ""
"<strong>Finalidad</strong><br />Sus datos serán usados para poder atender "
"sus solicitudes y prestarle nuestros servicios."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Purpose</strong><br />Your data will be used to respond to your "
"requests and provide our services."

#: templates/contact/success.html:42
msgid ""
"<strong>Publicidad</strong><br />Solo le enviaremos publicidad con su "
"autorización previa, que podrá facilitarnos mediante la casilla "
"correspondiente establecida al efecto."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Advertising</strong><br />We will only send you advertising with "
"your prior authorization, which you can provide by checking the "
"corresponding box provided for this purpose."

#: templates/contact/success.html:43
msgid ""
"<strong>Legitimación</strong><br />Únicamente trataremos sus datos con su "
"consentimiento previo, que podrá facilitarnos mediante la casilla "
"correspondiente establecida al efecto."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Legitimation</strong><br />We will only process your data with your "
"prior consent, which you can provide by checking the corresponding box "
"provided for this purpose."

#: templates/contact/success.html:44
msgid ""
"<strong>Destinatarios</strong><br />Con carácter general, sólo el personal "
"de nuestra entidad que esté debidamente autorizado podrá tener conocimiento "
"de la información que le pedimos."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Recipients</strong><br />Generally, only duly authorized personnel "
"of our organization may have access to the information we request."

#: templates/contact/success.html:45
msgid ""
"<strong>Derechos</strong><br />Tiene derecho a saber qué información tenemos "
"sobre usted, corregirla y eliminarla, tal y como se explica en la "
"información adicional disponible en nuestra página web. Así mismo, también "
"podrá ejercer el derecho de Portabilidad, solicitando el traspaso de su "
"información a otra entidad."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Rights</strong><br />You have the right to know what information we "
"have about you, correct it, and delete it, as explained in the additional "
"information available on our website. You may also exercise your right to "
"data portability by requesting the transfer of your information to another "
"entity."

#: templates/contact/success.html:46
msgid ""
"<strong>Información adicional</strong><br />Más información en el apartado "
"\"<a href=\"/page/1/politica-pivacidad/\">Política de privacidad</a>\" de "
"nuestra página web."
msgstr ""
"<strong>Additional Information</strong><br />More information in the <a "
"href=\"/page/1/privacy-policy/\">Privacy Policy</a>\" section of our website."
